
### 1. Create customer
POST http://localhost:8081/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Elias",
  "lastName": "Rinne",
  "email": "elias.rinne@example.fi",
  "phone": null
}

> {%
    client.log("Customer: " + JSON.stringify(response.body));
    client.global.set("customerId", response.body.id.toString());
%}


### 2. Create order
POST http://localhost:8081/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "deliveryDate": "2026-11-01T12:00:00",
  "shippingAddressId": null,
  "status": "NEW"
}

> {%
    client.log("Order: " + JSON.stringify(response.body));
    client.global.set("orderId", response.body.id.toString());
%}


### 3. GET all orders (paginated)
GET http://localhost:8081/orders?page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json


### 4. GET orders by status
GET http://localhost:8081/orders?status=NEW&page=0&size=10
Accept: application/json


### 5. GET orders by customer
GET http://localhost:8081/orders?customerId={{customerId}}
Accept: application/json


### 6. GET orders by customer and status
GET http://localhost:8081/orders?customerId={{customerId}}&status=NEW
Accept: application/json


### 7. GET created order by ID
GET http://localhost:8081/orders/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json


### 8. GET order items
GET http://localhost:8081/orders/{{orderId}}/items
Accept: application/json


### 9. PUT update order
PUT http://localhost:8081/orders/{{orderId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": {{customerId}},
  "deliveryDate": "2026-11-05T14:00:00",
  "shippingAddressId": null,
  "status": "NEW"
}


### 10. PATCH update order status
PATCH http://localhost:8081/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "PROCESSING"
}


### 11. GET updated order
GET http://localhost:8081/orders/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json


### 12. GET invalid order (expected 404)
GET http://localhost:8081/orders/999999999
Accept: application/json


### 13. DELETE order
# Run only AFTER deleting its orderitems!
DELETE http://localhost:8081/orders/{{orderId}}


### 14. Verify order deletion (expected 404)
GET http://localhost:8081/orders/{{orderId}}
Accept: application/json
